{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fdb457fdb61b8215435bdf3dde998cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; KKS, I so feel your pain.&amp;nbsp; I was going to use&amp;nbsp;the Sensation&amp;nbsp;as an option for my guest to arrive to Nassau for my wedding. I ended up using RC because of their 12P-12A i&lt;span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"&gt;tinerary.&amp;nbsp; How did everything go?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1631190,"PostDate":1339636226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> KKS, I so feel your pain.\u00a0 I was going to use\u00a0the Sensation\u00a0as an option for my guest to arrive to Nassau for my wedding. I ended up using RC because of their 12P-12A i<span  style=\"font-family: \"font-size: 11pt\">tinerary.\u00a0 How did everything go?<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shchwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338831902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256233.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":248,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Islandsunrise","Id":256233,"Name":"Islandsunrise","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d263909b4b8f2f945971cd876518ef59","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Carnival Sensation Bride here! 12\/9\/12..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1631641,"PostDate":1339721945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Carnival Sensation Bride here! 12\/9\/12..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvette4944@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338524287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"marquisyvette","Id":256116,"Name":"marquisyvette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82c462c940a370c8abb608511806ff31","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Carnival Sensation Bride here! 12\/9\/12&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1631642,"PostDate":1339722061,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Carnival Sensation Bride here! 12\/9\/12<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvette4944@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338524287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"marquisyvette","Id":256116,"Name":"marquisyvette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abb32a825381d09023dd4bed74ac3c67","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Islandsunrise\"]\nKKS, I so feel your pain.  I was going to use the Sensation as an option for my guest to arrive to Nassau for my wedding. I ended up using RC because of their 12P-12A i&lt;span style=\"line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, &#039;sans-serif&#039;;font-size:11pt;\"&gt;tinerary.  How did everything go?&lt;\/span&gt;[\/quote] Over all everything was really nice. The three things that rubbed me wrong was that 3 of my guests we not put on the list (after the lady called to double check the list and they were on it) i only got one bite of my cake and they threw the reat away when i was told they would serve the extra at dinner and they threw my take home marriage license away \" because it looked like regular paper\". Currently waiting for the official lincense to change everything over. One thing I would suggest is to talk with you on board coordinator before the first night dinner and ensure that everything is the same as you sent it. Identify a person for the land side coordinator to give everything to because you will be busy with people and taking pictures. After that, things are very busy and things may be overlooked. They refunded the money but my friend and her husband only came there for my wedding and they were unable to be there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1634207,"PostDate":1340398749,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Islandsunrise\" url=\"\/t\/75441\/carnival&#045;sensation&#045;brides\/10#post_1780758\"><p>KKS, I so feel your pain.\u00a0 I was going to use\u00a0the Sensation\u00a0as an option for my guest to arrive to Nassau for my wedding. I ended up using RC because of their 12P-12A i<span  style=\"font-family:Calibri,'sans-serif';font-size:11pt;\">tinerary.\u00a0 How did everything go?<\/span><\/p><\/blockquote> Over all everything was really nice. The three things that rubbed me wrong was that 3 of my guests we not put on the list (after the lady called to double check the list and they were on it) i only got one bite of my cake and they threw the reat away when i was told they would serve the extra at dinner and they threw my take home marriage license away \" because it looked like regular paper\". Currently waiting for the official lincense to change everything over. One thing I would suggest is to talk with you on board coordinator before the first night dinner and ensure that everything is the same as you sent it. Identify a person for the land side coordinator to give everything to because you will be busy with people and taking pictures. After that, things are very busy and things may be overlooked. They refunded the money but my friend and her husband only came there for my wedding and they were unable to be there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312172737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243058.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kks2012","Id":243058,"Name":"kks2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d6b4ee02a859c052bf54cfc94f0a51d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; to @lightskinnedgal Congrats! wat date in oct of 2013 are you going? I plan on getting married on the sensation in 2013 of october as well!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1640674,"PostDate":1342071561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> to @lightskinnedgal Congrats! wat date in oct of 2013 are you going? I plan on getting married on the sensation in 2013 of october as well!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"senoratoliferro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338442124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256070.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"breezy1656","Id":256070,"Name":"breezy1656","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"038bfce892188fa583141182d743c2ca","RawContent":"&lt;pre&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;I am getting married on 11\/08\/2012!!&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/pre&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are getting married on 11\/08\/2012. We just submitted our contract and cake order. We are actually getting married at port before the ship sets sail so that some of our family and friends that can&#039;t sail with us can still join us for the ceremony. It looks like we will have apprx. 30 guest including the wedding party. Did any of you buy the pics that are way over priced? and did any of you rent a D.J.?&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1649411,"PostDate":1344217705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <pre>&lt;span  style=\"font-size: 20px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;I am getting married on 11\/08\/2012!!&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;<\/pre> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 20px\"><strong><em>We are getting married on 11\/08\/2012. We just submitted our contract and cake order. We are actually getting married at port before the ship sets sail so that some of our family and friends that can't sail with us can still join us for the ceremony. It looks like we will have apprx. 30 guest including the wedding party. Did any of you buy the pics that are way over priced? and did any of you rent a D.J.?<\/em><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fhallgirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1344217338,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258806.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Felicia1182012","Id":258806,"Name":"Felicia1182012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38ce582fb39b29d3b03db91eb37c4bd3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Im getting married on 11\/08\/2012 on the Sensation. Did any of you purchase the pic packages that carnival has listed? The packages start around $500. I think that is over prices. I was wondering if you think it was worth the money or should I invite my friends and family to take pics and photo shop them later???? also for the hour reception, did anyone purchase the live entertainment or D.J. ? or do you recommend against it??&amp;nbsp;What flowers did they have for you&amp;nbsp;for the ceremony? If you have pics please post!!!&amp;nbsp;thx in advance!!! Felicia&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1649414,"PostDate":1344218394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Im getting married on 11\/08\/2012 on the Sensation. Did any of you purchase the pic packages that carnival has listed? The packages start around $500. I think that is over prices. I was wondering if you think it was worth the money or should I invite my friends and family to take pics and photo shop them later???? also for the hour reception, did anyone purchase the live entertainment or D.J. ? or do you recommend against it??\u00a0What flowers did they have for you\u00a0for the ceremony? If you have pics please post!!!\u00a0thx in advance!!! Felicia<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fhallgirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1344217338,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258806.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Felicia1182012","Id":258806,"Name":"Felicia1182012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d4f5c172405e58f3d8002c5f3211066","RawContent":"Kks2012, Did you have your wedding on board the ship or shoreside in Nassau?","Attachments":[],"Id":1650863,"PostDate":1344551651,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Kks2012, Did you have your wedding on board the ship or shoreside in Nassau?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"enj3755@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.247.160.79","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1339876386,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256758.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"emilyj","Id":256758,"Name":"emilyj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93a6f3dbd58356d800b5b8544e6a4f87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am also trying to figure out other reception options besides the Nightclub b\/c I don&#039;t like to look. Unfortunately this is the only location where you can have a DJ.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1652538,"PostDate":1344967117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am also trying to figure out other reception options besides the Nightclub b\/c I don't like to look. Unfortunately this is the only location where you can have a DJ.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"enj3755@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.247.160.79","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1339876386,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256758.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"emilyj","Id":256758,"Name":"emilyj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87481d1d581a5a7efa696bf0d00ea114","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am getting married on 9\/9\/12 - 19 days to go... I will let ya&#039;ll know how it goes.. I have rented a dj... Im getting married in the Michael Angelo lounge and reception is in the Kaleidoscope disco. We have 59 guests.. 26 are sailing. I have been searching for what the cake looks like.. wheteher to bring any decorations for the cake so it&#039;s not so white. and then picture ideas. we plan on buying the package that 750$. so we will see - after the wedding I will post some so you guys can see.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1655082,"PostDate":1345576934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am getting married on 9\/9\/12 - 19 days to go... I will let ya'll know how it goes.. I have rented a dj... Im getting married in the Michael Angelo lounge and reception is in the Kaleidoscope disco. We have 59 guests.. 26 are sailing. I have been searching for what the cake looks like.. wheteher to bring any decorations for the cake so it's not so white. and then picture ideas. we plan on buying the package that 750$. so we will see - after the wedding I will post some so you guys can see.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chall@flsouthern.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345576468,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259448.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gooseontheloose","Id":259448,"Name":"gooseontheloose","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":30,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
